
# Notebooks are GENERATED (notebooks/_build_notebook_*.py --execute) and full
# of volatile JSON (execution counts, random cell ids, timestamps). Git must
# never text-merge them — that produces conflict-marker soup inside JSON.
# Marked binary: a conflict becomes a whole-file choice; resolve by keeping
# either side, then regenerate: python notebooks/_build_notebook_01.py --execute
*.ipynb -text -diff -merge linguist-generated=true
